Sophisticated Technology Solutions Software License Agreement

1. Definitions:
a. "Company" refers to Sophisticated Technology Solutions, the entity holding the rights to the software.
b. "Programmers" refers to the individuals employed or contracted by Sophisticated Technology Solutions to develop software.
c. "Software" refers to any and all code, applications, programs, scripts, and associated documentation developed by Programmers under the employment or contract of Sophisticated Technology Solutions.

2. License Grant:
a. Ownership: The Software developed by Programmers under the employment or contract of Sophisticated Technology Solutions shall be the exclusive property of Sophisticated Technology Solutions.
b. Usage: Sophisticated Technology Solutions grants non-transferable, non-exclusive rights to use the Software solely for internal business purposes.
c. Restrictions: Programmers or any other party are explicitly prohibited from copying, distributing, modifying, sublicensing, selling, or otherwise transferring the Software or any part thereof without prior written consent from Sophisticated Technology Solutions.

3. Confidentiality:
a. Confidential Information: Programmers shall treat all aspects of the Software development process and the Software itself as confidential information belonging to Sophisticated Technology Solutions.
b. Non-Disclosure: Programmers shall not disclose any information related to the Software to any third party without explicit written consent from Sophisticated Technology Solutions.

4. Intellectual Property:
a. Ownership: Sophisticated Technology Solutions retains all intellectual property rights, title, and interest in and to the Software, including any enhancements, modifications, or derivative works thereof.
b. Attribution: Any copies of the Software must include appropriate copyright notices and proprietary designations as specified by Sophisticated Technology Solutions.

5. Termination:
a. Breach: In the event of a breach of this Agreement by any Programmer, Sophisticated Technology Solutions reserves the right to terminate the employment or contract of said Programmer and pursue legal remedies.
b. Consequences: Upon termination of employment or contract, all rights granted to Programmers under this Agreement shall cease, and Programmers must promptly return or destroy all copies of the Software and any related materials in their possession.

6. Governing Law:
This Agreement shall be governed by and construed following the laws of Indonesia, without regard to its conflict of law provisions.

7. Miscellaneous:
a. Severability: If any provision of this Agreement is held to be invalid or unenforceable, the remaining provisions shall remain in full force and effect.
b. Entire Agreement: This Agreement constitutes the entire agreement between Sophisticated Technology Solutions and Programmers concerning the subject matter herein and supersedes all prior and contemporaneous agreements and communications.
